historical_references = "Researcher-approved Phase 1–4 text, 4 October 2026. Princess Urduja is a legendary cultural figure associated with Pangasinan; historical identification remains debated. Ibn Battuta’s Tawalisi account does not conclusively identify Pangasinan."
media_credits = "Artwork: Romeo C. Mananquil. Digital reproduction image: researcher-supplied repository asset. Photographer, reproduction source and permission/license undocumented.\n\nMagnifier samples the same 364×442 image; it does not create additional detail.\n\nNarration: researcher-supplied and approved despite duplicate detection. Individual recording credit/rights unresolved."
transcript = "A painting of Princess Urduja by Romeo C. Mananquil is displayed near the entrance of Urduja House. Princess Urduja is remembered as a legendary warrior figure associated with Pangasinan. The historical identification of Princess Urduja remains debated, but she continues to hold cultural significance in Pangasinan."
